OL,3,GNEWSAMan cleared of smashing historic
OL,4,ARoman wall
OL,5,
OL,6,FA Lincoln man has been cleared of
OL,7,Fsmashing a historic Roman wall after
OL,8,FCCTV of the incident proved to be
OL,9,Finconclusive.
OL,11,FJason James, 46, pleaded not guilty to
OL,12,Fcriminal damage, saying he had been in
OL,13,Fbed all night.
OL,15,FHe appeared before Lincoln Magistrates'
OL,16,FCourt on Thursday, accused of causing
OL,17,Fmore than #6,000 of damage to the wall
OL,18,Fon Beaumont Fee overnight between 23
OL,19,Fand 24 August 2025.
OL,23,APub: 11-SepQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageBYrk Lincs NewsCReg TVFWeather
FL,386,380,200,160,0,100
