OL,3,GNEWSAMan cleared of smashing historic
OL,4,ARoman wall
OL,5,
OL,6,FDistrict Judge Daniel Church said:
OL,7,F"I've spent time looking at the
OL,8,Ffootage. The stills from the CCTV look
OL,9,Fsimilar to the defendant, but I can go
OL,10,Fno further than saying the person might
OL,11,Fbe you ` it also might not be. I must
OL,12,Ffind you not guilty."
